{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 26, :comments ["<b>Six.</b> So it shall be always, all the time you are in the wilderness, as it was now when you gathered it six days." "And on the seventh day it shall not be, that the manna descends, and He added to it. An addition of explanation, like, \"and from the tree of knowledge of good and evil, you shall not eat of it\" (Genesis 2:17)."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:35:08.769502399Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}